      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Marcus and Elena are perfect for the high-society drama, representing the established elite. Jax and Andre fit the gritty crime drama perfectly, embodying the street-level life. Kenji could work in either, but his discipline leans towards the high-society world, while his intelligence could make him a valuable asset in a crime setting. You risk relying on stereotypes with Jax and Andre, so make sure their complexity goes beyond just their environment.",
      "source": "target",
